lyrics_text:
1
Law lah, Bawilen Sengp'hrang,
Na ming thangthenna ham;
Thangpawmsak lah,
Aka bawilen a Pa;
Soeprep boeih te a taa,
Law lah, kaimi saw ah;
Hinroek bawi lah.

2
Pumsa la ka coeng Awl,
Na samsen oen n'toet lah;
Thangthuina ang,
Na thlaangthli youtheensak;
Na taana awl te m'peek,
Lawlah, a Ciim Muithla;
Kaimi saw ah.

3
Law, ka ciim ngaimawngkung,
Ka ciim awlhuep sausi;
Khuen lang awmngaih,
Ka bawilen  sawsang koek;
Thinkaw roek dawng bawi lah,
N'cehtaak manawh Muithla,
Tharaana lawng.

4
Bawilen, Thumkhat Pathen,
Dungyaan la ka koeh ai;
Dungroek dawngah,
Sawsang koek na bawina;
Bawilenna dawng mami,
Dungyaan toela lungna,
Hinyahna n'huh.

1
Aw ka theen tangkiik Pathen,
Ka cim koekla na awm;
Nang oen ka vai u awm nawh,
Nuehtah thai koei awm nawh;
Ciimna boeih kah a ciimna,
Khawhi huilawng a thui;
Na tharaa oen na coengna,
Na theen tangkiik mah aw.

2
A rawl awmnawh langloe la,
Soeng bueng muehla ciim bal;
Voetthoekna khat khaw awmnawh,
Soepbir tare Bawipa;
Tulawng khaw Nang n'yoei thai nawh,
Nang ang u khaw awm nawh;
Nang kah paihuen ka rawt tah,
Nang aka tuk thlaang ni.

3
Ka theen koek lak ah theen ngaai,
Ka soeng koek lak ah soeng;
A theenna langloe la awm,
Tu oen khaw tah thai nawh;
Doengna tloe oen lou u nawh,
A pumboeih la na theen;
Me ang theenna lawng pha nawh,
Na theenna thang khawnghak.

4
Na ciimna tah theen tangkiik,
Kaimi ham nan roek bah;
He a langloe na coengna,
Kaimi lawng ka rekra;
Na theenna dawng ka rekra,
Na coengna ka khueh u;
Ka ciim hingna hu ka vai,
Hamkhuek la roengna toe.

5
Bawipa koeh oen kan bawk u,
Na ciimna boeih dawngah;
Aka theen thlang na coengna,
Pha thai leknawh la sang;
Langloe oen a rawl awm nawh,
Na coengna ka koeh u;
Thloek la hoep u na coengna,
Dungyaan kaimi ham ni.

1
A Pa Pathen, Nang kan bawk u,
Na doengna a phu awm ham;
Khrih dawng na awm kai nan doengsak,
Theetheen mingna a tha yawl;
Nang kah doengna oen uep-awmna,
Na doengna dawng ka pai u;
Nang dawngah doengna nawh awmnawh,
Na doeng kut lawng mel thai nawh.

2
Jesuh dawng thawlhnathli na hal,
Na doengna dawngah te duek;
Ka ciim na awlpeek kah ngoena,
Na doengna a soepsak ham;
Laiba na van sahna rang oen,
Bawipa ngaikhuekna soepbir;
Metitluk Bawipa a doengna,
Mami tengah te phawng u.

3
Aw Pa Pathen Nang kan dou u,
Jesuh tah kaimi yueng la;
Thlaangdoeng nawh ham thlaangdoeng awlcek,
Na poekna thawleng u nawh;
Ka soep doengna na tuengsak poen,
Na bantang kut ben ah ngawl;
Bawipa tah Nang na ngaikhuekna,
Na ngoe doengna hamla khoek.

4
A Pa, Jesuh kah thi rang oen,
Na doengna te ka khueh u;
Na doengna lawng n'thlipthung rang oen,
U lawngkhaw n'tuensak thai nawh;
Namah lawng na sai doengna te,
U lawng khaw thawlhpel thainawh;
Jerusalem khawthai atah,
Dungyaan kan paipui u ai.

1
Law u thik-at la koeh u sih,
Pathen kah a lungna;
Vaan oen dilai lawng a koeh tah,
Pathen kah a lungna;
Thawlh kalawng thlaang a hinghangsak,
A thinkaw dawng kah tingtoeng awl;
Jesuh hamla laa sa u sih,
Pathen kah a lungna.

2
He n'tahaam dawng metluk awmngaih!
Pathen kah a lungna;
Awlkhueh rang oen n'muithla tharaa,
Pathen kah a lungna;
Khawmik oen ah ka thlipthungkung,
Bawmkung, ngai-uepna, tharaana;
Ame huen ah khaw n'awm pui ai,
Pathen kah a lungna.

3
Bawilenna dawngah n'koeh u ai,
Pathen kah a lungna;
Thaa khueh nawh veng tharaana tah,
Pathen kah a lungna;
Ka boet nawh tuethli dawng ming awm,
Vaan ngawlhcoen dawng tingtoeng awl oen;
Didiip laa n'sak phaat hamlatah,
Pathen kah a lungna.

1
Thaihu na suen thlan veng kalawng,
Lungna dawngah nan tuek poen;
Te lungna tah dung tih hinghuen,
Mami Khrih teng la n'ceh pui;
N'buehthawng poepa, n'buehthawng poepa,
Khrih dawng buengah te n'caksak;
Khrih dawng buengah te n'caksak.

2
Dilai thawleng u mai cakhaw,
Pathen tah thawleng u nawh;
A reenna oen a sai paipi,
Dung roek dawngah cak poepa;
Pathen cathli, Pathen cathli,
A ming boet ouh-la koeh u;
A ming boet ouh-la koeh u.

3
Pathen lungna kai kah yaancil,
Hinroek ah ka ooek pui ai;
Reen loeihdemna tlumhawn nawh,
Ka ngoena n'nueh, lawngpui n'mawt;
Pathen lawng n'reen, Pathen lawng n'reen,
Khuehduen a Capa te m'peek;
Khuehduen a Capa te m'peek.

4
Lungna Pa, tahe na haai ah,
Na lungna kan koeh poe u;
Ka boet thainawh koehna pang awl,
Capa oen n'hum u toela;
Bawilen hawnseh, bawilen hawnseh,
Pathen oen Tuuca haai ah;
Pathen oen Tuuca haai ah.

1
Bawilen koek Pa koeh u sih,
Bawipa kah lungvatna;
Na thinkaw awmngaihsakkung,
Tahe na haai ah awm;
Bawilen ham cathli na noek,
Dungyaan lawng na ming poen;
Bawipa lungna Jesuh Khrih,
A sawsang koek la awm.

2
Aw Bawipa a tloe, awmnawh,
Bawipa na Capa dawng;
Muithla oen youtheen nan peek,
Bawipa koe la n'awm u;
Bawilenna dawngah  thik-at la,
Yoeyah la ng'awm u poen ai;
A muime dawng n'ang u ai,
A dungyaan toe, Amen.

1
A Pa Pathen, nan ceelna,
Capa tengla ka mang;
Capa dawngah na awmngaih,
Na kawngaih boeih a coeng;
Phutlou koek rou bawm rang oen,
Na raang zoela nan peek;
Bawipa kah ka cuem lungna,
Na ngaih tah thlawnna ni.

2
Aw Pa Pathen kah reenna,
Na awl na thawleng nawh;
Aka ang koek ngai-uuepna,
Phutlou Khrih ming dawng cuut;
Naha dawng didiip dingrue,
Boet ouh-la ring poepa;
Thawlh oen rihna kalawngah,
Ka hingna pumboeih loeih.

3
Thlangthawlhthli rih oen thuen u,
Pathen lawng hilh thai nawh;
Laiba vaila biit a sah,
A kuem laibathli boeih;
Loeihdemsak late awm poen,
Kaimi lungbui n'kousak;
Lungna Capa duekna lawng,
Pumboeih la n'loeihsak poen.

4
Oengcathli mami sawah,
Pathen thinsa tlaih nawh;
Lakueng rihna awm tlaih nawh,
A lungna n'dang poen dawng;
Thawlh yut caathli te a mawk,
A phaw lip a buensak;
Lungbui rih awmnathli boeih,
Lungna lawng boeih a taa.

1
Aw Pathen kah a kawngaih,
Capa dawng n'mingsak poen;
Toeklek nawh tahthailek nawh,
Youtheenna ka thui u;
Nahai ah ka kuun u poen,
Vaan kah Thlaang lawng a ming;
Bawilenna laklung Bawipa,
Na poekna Bawipa dawng.

2
Lungna tah awmngaihna ni,
Na mik-hai dawng angna;
Bawilen koek huen kalawngah,
Youtheen angna valaawng;
Nang kah lungna oen angna,
Na coengna ka phawng u;
Poekrai lungvatna te tueng,
Capa mami tahaam.

3
Youtheenna kungpui Bawipa,
Awmngaihna hingna tui;
Nang Ming awmngaih oen phawng u,
Thlangcimthli khat la awm;
Thinkhaw rip lawng a koeh u,
Koehna boeih Bawipa ni;
Hinyahna awl thangkhawkseh,
"Pathen tah lungna ni"

1
Pa Pathen, youtheen kan peek,
Na hai ah ka awmngaih;
Duekna yinhuep tuiral ah,
Youtheen ka rekra u;
Na hai ah Thlaang pakhat hing,
Vaan dawng khawcil angna;
Tahthailek nawh nan lungna,
Dungyaan toe nan lungna.

2
Bawipa oen mami kah Pa,
Kaimi kah Pa Pathen;
Bawipa na lungna Capa,
Na thinkaw ngaikhueksak;
Kaimi khaw ka awmngaih u,
Bawipa ka rekra u;
Na lungna te ming hamla,
Namik hai kah angna.

3
Na lungna oen nan pinyen,
Dingdeuh tih yip auh nawh;
Na lungna tah laklungkir,
Amah lawng n'lungna poen;
Namah dawng Bawilen lungna,
Dungyaan duemna n'huh poen;
Yahawh thlang miamanauthli,
Namah dawng youtheenna.

1
Jesuh ming ka lungna,
Bawipa Jesuh;
Ming boeihboeih lak sang ngai,
Bawipa Jesuh;
Nang tah thaihu soeprep,
Kaimi tah a hawnghi;
Nang nawh tah a hawnghi,
Bawipa Jesuh.

2
Thlaang Capa la na awm,
Bawipa Jesuh;
Kai ham hingna nan peek,
Bawipa Jesuh;
Nan lungna bou tangkiik,
Lungna boeihboeih lak-ah;
Lungna na tuengsak poen,
Bawipa Jesuh.

3
Nang dawng bueng doengna awm,
Bawipa Jesuh;
Nangdawng bueng ying demna,
Bawipa Jesuh;
U nuem ka rih bal ai,
Lakueng raina awm khaw;
Ka teng na awm yoeyah,
Bawipa Jesuh;

4
Na law yue koep poen ai,
Bawipa Jesuh;
Ka awmngaih u poen ai,
Bawipa Jesuh;
Namik hai ka huh veng,
Namah phek la awm ai;
Namah oen dungyaan toe,
Bawipa Jesuh.

1
Bawipa na Ming tah Jesuh ni,
Kawpoekrai lungna koei Ming;
Hula cuem lawng cuunla Na awm,
Thlaang Capa la te na coeng;
Kaimi kah Jehovah Thlawnkung,
Thawlhnathli dawng lawng nan thlawn;
Thlawnkung la kan dang u vengah,
Ka khui hingna tawng u poen.

2
Khrih tila khaw kan khue u bal,
Na bibina ben kah Ming;
Pathen situi suep la na awm,
A dungyaan tue veng kalawng;
Pathen Messiah lakhaw awm,
Lungna dawng Pathen lawng tuek;
A poekna na soepbirsak ai,
A bawilenna tuengsak ham.

3
"Immanuel" la khaw na awm,
"Pathen oen haih awm" hamla;
Lungvatna rang oen boeih n'thooek u,
Thlanghing coengna kaimi oen;
Thingan dawng Pathen na tueng u,
Awltak, lungvatna oen be;
Pathen Bawilen Nang dawng ka huh,
Oengna rang oen n'tuhkai u.

4
Naming ciimna kan hinyah u,
Kaimi tengah na van awng;
Phutlou bawtuinathli boeih oen,
Lungna oen kan phoeih poe ai;
Phutlou Thlawnkung kan hinyah u,
Bawipa Nangni kan bawk u;
Emmanuel kan thangpawm u,
Boet ouh-la kan koeh u ai.

1
Bawilenna oen law,
Hing poepa a yancil;
Thlawnkung Pathen va law,
A ming Jesuh a sak;
Vaitaw khawng dawng thang,
Kamyin angla te awm;
Kawthe mikphi khawdeng patang akhang.

Chorus
Bawipa ka lungna, Bawipa ka hinyah,
Hingna khawmik oen soeprep la awm;
Suenkung Bawi boukoek, ka Thlawnkung la awm,
Pathen betooetna, Bawipa dawng awm.။

2
Metih hep awm cakhaw,
Tlangna te avan khuen;
Duekna khawyin tiim ah,
Ngai-uepna awm tlaihnawh;
Pathen lungna reenna,
Bawilenna cehtaak tih;
Mami he thlawn ham taa ham va law thuk.

Chorus
Bawipa ka lungna, Bawipa ka hinyah,
Hingna khawmik oen soeprep la awm;
Suenkung Bawi boukoek, ka Thlawnkung la awm,
Pathen betooetna, Bawipa dawng awm.

3
Ngaihna thinkaw oen,
A pumsa a pum dawng;
Thlanghing coengna a khuen,
Thuh awlhuep a tuengsak;
Aw awlhuep bawilenna,
Thinglam dawng aduekna;
" Kai tah Kai ni " ka ti Bawipa kan ming.

Chorus
Bawipa ka lungna, Bawipa ka hinyah,
Hingna khawmik oen soeprep la awm;
Suenkung Bawi boukoek, ka Thlawnkung la awm,
Pathen betooetna, Bawipa dawng awm.

1
Hutung vanthlaang laa sak awl,
Bawilen seh Bawi thai vathang;
Dilai roepna oen reenna,
Pathen oen thlaangthawlh roepna;
Namtawmthli boeih awmngaih u,
Vaanthli kah a pangna awl;
Vanthlaangthli lawng a phawng tah,
Bethlehem ah Khrih thang poen.

2
Khrih, sawsang koek lungna bawi,
Khrih, a yoeyah bawi la awm;
A lawna tue dawng ngaithuen,
Hula cuem khui kalawng thang;
Pathen pumsa dawngah n'huh,
Pathen pumsa la va coeng;
Thlaang angla thlaang oen haih awm,
Jesuh tah Immanuel.

3
Vaan lawng ka thang Roepna bawi,
Doengna khawmik vase poen;
Angna oen hingna van khuen,
Aphe rawi dawng hoeihna oen;
A bawilenna oen a helh,
Ka thang thlaang duek tlaih manawh;
Dilai dawng cathli pungtaai,
Pebe cuun thaina a peek.

4
Ka ngaihthli boeih va law u,
A dungvoeng im dawng n'khoeksak;
Taana cadil huta cuun,
Mami dawng rul lu a neet;
Adam muime na phe tih,
Namah mui ang la nan sai;
Hukhueng Adam saw ben kah,
Lungna dawng koep nan phasak.

1
Na Lu dawng boengha ngawthli,
Theekha tlawhna oen be;
The a phoei boengha ngawthli,
Tamdengna thling lumuek;
Na Lu dawngah bepoek la,
Bawilenna ang rawngtheeng;
Duek toe boengha tlawhna oen,
Thephoeina thing dawng toe.

2
A mik-hai theen thlang mah aw,
Nang tah hingna khawmik;
Lai thlaangthli a hangdangna,
A bawh u, thamthoeih u;
Metihtluk patang na khang,
Thawlh thalrih te na phuih;
Yahawh thlang kaimi laiba,
Thisen oen nan sah poen.

3
Uemcil a tak la kan thui,
Ka Thlawnkung paya theen;
Kaimi ham thi a lawngsak,
Muithla rang oen nan bawm;
Na uep-awmna dawngah te,
Cakca la nan paisak;
Bawilenna oen nan lawh toe,
Mik-hai theen kan huh u.

1
Jesuh dungyaan hingna Kungpui,
Jesuh ka hilna tharaa;
Selkhui tharaana ka Taakung,
A duekna oen a taa poen;
Ngaihang khawbingna khui kalawng,
Kaimi thlawnna bi na van coeng;
Thawngsang thawngsang koehna be,
Bawilenna Bawipa dawngah.

2
Pathen Capa Nang lawng na ueh,
Boethe tamdeng thekhana;
Bawilen sengphrang Nanglawng na muek,
Kaimi yuengla thling lumuek;
Duekna rang oen nan loeihsak u,
Dungyaan thawlh pinyenna khui lawng;
Thawngsang thawngsang koehna be,
Phutlou Thlawnkung Namah dawng.

3
Thlaang kah yahrau pawhna na phuih,
Thinsan ruila te na ueh;
Duektoe tlawhna te na ueh tih,
Kaimi tlangna te na coeng;
Kawpoekrai na yarau pawhna,
Kaimi thlawnna bi coeng hamla;
Thawngsang thawngsang koehna be,
Phutlou Thlawnkung Namah dawng.

4
Lungna koehna oen hinyahna,
Thlawnkung Namah teng kan peek;
Na hingna dawng yarau pawhna,
Na duek dawngah ka hing u;
Kawthe lungnatna boeih na ueh,
Awmngaihna boeih Nang kan yingna;
Boet ouh-la phawng hamkoei tah,
Bawipa teng uemcil thuina.

1
Metih kawpoek rai na tlangna,
Ka Bawipa lawng vansai;
Ka huh, ka yaak ka poek vai nawh,
Bawipa na bisaina;
Pathen coengna tah dung mah aw,
Awl oen ka thui leknawh;
Kawpoek la rai na tlangna te,
Ka koehna boet thainawh.

2
Thinglam dawngah caai oen athun,
Thisen oen tui vathoeng;
Kaimi hamla hingna nan peek,
Tlang tela ka awm u;
Phutlou thisen oen n'ciimsak poen,
Kaimi dawngah awm poen;
Na hingna oen ah nan cuun poen,
Namah oen ah pakhat.

3
Pathen kah cangti la na duek,
A thaih yahawh van khuen;
Tetah ka thooek a Takpum ni,
Na coengna na rekra;
Bawipa Nang kah roengna kaimi,
Kaimi na awmna im;
Kaimi rang oen Bawipa na hing,
Na tatvut tih na tueng.

4
Na Takpum la ka awm coeng tah,
Kaimi khui na awm poen;
Kaimi dawngah im na huh poen,
Kaimi nan uepna poen;
Na thinkaw ngaikhuek awmngaihna,
Nayu la ka awm u;
Na mah oen Pum khat la ka awm,
Nang kan awmngaihna u.

5
M'poekkhuepna dawngah te n'hum u,
Noekna te tahe n'huh;
Na tlangna tah bou tih soepbir,
Koehna oen ka be u;
Na Takpum la nan sai kalawng,
Vasahula oen im;
Awmngaihna oen kan bawk u ai,
Boet ouh-la kan koeh ai.

1
Aw m'pha thai lek nawh a dungna,
Lungna Bawipa, nan lungna;
Mah tha oen tah thaila awmnawh,
Dung koek tuitun lak dung ngai;
Ka tlou tangkiik oen na duek tih,
Kai khuiah Nang na awm poen;
Namah dawngah ka cawng u tih,
Na beek la ni ka awm poen.

2
Kai ham nan khuen poekrai lungna,
U lawng nuem a thui lek ai;
Aka bou koek poekraina oen,
A bawilenna khui n'khuen poen;
Aw! na lungna kai ham nan peek,
A pumboeih la kan rekra;
Ka soeng hingna Nang kan rekra,
Na bawina dawng ka awmngaih.

3
Bawipa Pathen na hingna oen,
Bawipa lungna na tuengsak;
Pathen kah a muime angla,
Ka soepbir hingna na sai;
Na lungvatna tah khoek mah aw,
Hin roek ka tahaam la awm;
Ka didiip na bawtui thaihu,
Kai lawngah ka teng poepa.

4
Nang oen n'tu lawngah m'pek thai ai?
A boettoe la nan lungna;
Aw! nan lungna tah tlou tangkiik,
Kai dawngah Nang na thooek u;
Pahih n'law de catah pakhat
Kai Bawipa, Bawipa kai la,
Tete ka sausi la awm ai,
A dungyaan Bawipa lungna.

1
Aw Bawipa Nang khing kan poek u,
Na cuihthoemna dawng kan bawk u;
Bawipa na bawi, kawpoek raina,
Na phu tlawhna ka huhtawng u.

Chorus
Ngoena boeih dawng Nang huh ka ngaih,
Kaimi dawngah koehna oen be;
Kaimi ngaihna na betooetsak,
Dungyaan la ka ngai nan khueksak;

2
Awltak la aka awm Pathen,
Angna oen lungna tah Pathen;
Pathen tah mami kah hingna,
Pathen dawng mami ng'awmngaih u.

Chorus
Ngoena boeih dawng Nang huh ka ngaih,
Kaimi dawngah koehna oen be;
Kaimi ngaihna na betooetsak,
Dungyaan la ka ngai nan khueksak;

3
Atak thlaang pakhat la na awm,
Sadingna, theenna, cuuemna, thlaang;
Pathen kawhoesakkung thlaang ni,
Thlipthungkung lungna thlaang la awm..

Chorus
Ngoena boeih dawng Nang huh ka ngaih,
Kaimi dawngah koehna oen be;
Kaimi ngaihna na betooetsak,
Dungyaan la ka ngai nan khueksak;

4
A hepawm tamnaa la na awm,
Kaimi bii bi ham Pathen sal;
Thinglam dawng duek toe awl na ngai,
Ka loeih thlaang la ka awm u poen

Chorus
Ngoena boeih dawng Nang huh ka ngaih,
Kaimi dawngah koehna oen be;
Kaimi ngaihna na betooetsak,
Dungyaan la ka ngai nan khueksak;

5
Bawipa tahe Sengpahrang Bawi,
Lungna oen hingna dawng Na uk;
Pathen lawng tharaana a suuep,
Mami ka Ukkung Bawi la awm.

Chorus
Ngoena boeih dawng Nang huh ka ngaih,
Kaimi dawngah koehna oen be;
Kaimi ngaihna na betooetsak,
Dungyaan la ka ngai nan khueksak;

6
Lungna Bawipa kan poek khing u,
Bawipa Nang oen ka tuhkai u;
Lungna dawng Nang ka awmngaih u,
Bawmcemkung la kan rekra u.

Chorus
Ngoena boeih dawng Nang huh ka ngaih,
Kaimi dawngah koehna oen be;
Kaimi ngaihna na betooetsak,
Dungyaan la ka ngai nan khueksak;

1
A Pa Pathen kah rang dawngah,
A tuethli a tawng thlan veng;
Nang tah Pa kah bawilen tuengna,
Pathen kah khuehduen Capa;
Pa lawng mami tengah m'peek veng,
Thlanghing coengna dawng n'vai u;
Pa kah a soepbirna la awm,
